PFTD core implementation

This distribution includes a source snapshot of Agent Distillation:
GitHub: Nardien/agent-distillation

Associated paper: Distilling LLM Agent into Small Models with Retrieval and Code Tools,
Minki Kang, Jongwon Jeong, Seanie Lee, Jaewoong Cho, and Sung Ju Hwang, 2025.

The upstream distribution incorporates smolagents and other third-party work.
Original source headers and the upstream Apache-2.0 license are preserved.
PFTD adds compilation, checking, curriculum, policy optimization and integration code.
The upstream README is shortened for the anonymous, hyperlink-free documentation.
This is not an official product of KRAFTON Inc. or DeepAuto.ai.

Manuscript figures are supplied by the PFTD authors for display with this project;
the source-code license does not override third-party datasets or figure rights.
